# Hashes of versioned files are part of the reproducibility contract (manifests,
# check-snapshots, the candidate table). Check text out with LF on every platform,
# whatever core.autocrlf says, so a Windows clone hashes the same bytes as a Linux one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
